  "ai.orion81Completely": "<0>Orion-81 nye dɔ si AI wɔ katã.<\/0> Orion-81 ŋutɔ ƒe kɔd sia kɔd woŋlɔe kple Claude Code, eye gɔmeɖola ye fia mɔe. Ʋu sia ʋu, anyigbagbɔ, nɔnɔme kple ɣli sia ɣli, dɔwɔnu siwo Claude Code ŋlɔ ye wɔe. Gɔmeɖola ye ɖoa nu si woawɔ; Claude Code ye kpɔa alesi woawɔe. Open-source agbalẽ siwo wòtsi ɖe dzi la le ŋkɔ te le 'Menye AI wɔ o' te le agbɔsɔsɔ me. Nu ɖeka gakpɔ le eme eye woɖe afia gaglãgbe: <1>mɔɖeɖe ƒe dodokpɔ<\/1> na fefe ƒe kɔd si tso GPL kpɔɖeŋu la me.",
