  "faq.becauseRevenueMeant": "Elabena eƒe fetu nye be wòaxe wo ga. Fefe la dze egɔme AI-wɔ blibo be wòanɔ anyi kura; emegbe nɔnɔmetatawɔla siwo woxɔ fetu na ye tsia AI ƒe dɔ teƒe, kple woƒe ŋkɔwo.",
