  "faq.freePlay": "Ðe fefe la xɔa fetu?",
  "faq.n07Questions": "07 · Nubiabiawo",
  "faq.notYetLan": "Ao, megali o. LAN ame geɖe ƒe fefe le network ɖeka dzi wɔa dɔ egbea (tso 0.2.0 me); womewɔ fefe le internet dzi o.",
  "faq.prototypeWasBuilt": "Wowɔ kpɔɖeŋu la ɖe open-source Quake III Arena mɔ̃ (GPL) dzi eye wotsɔ Elite Dangerous ƒe ʋuwo abe nusɔsrɔ̃ ene. Le ŋkeke evelia dzi, fefe la ƒe kɔd trɔ yi BuB dzi, mɔ̃ yeye si woŋlɔ kple Claude Code; fefe ƒe akpa siwo tso kpɔɖeŋu la me wotrɔ woƒe ŋkɔwo. Wɔwɔ 0.3.0 na ʋu ƒe ƒomevi 16 katã ʋu ƒe ŋutilã yeye. Mɔɖeɖe ƒe dodokpɔ aɖe le kpɔkpɔm ne kɔd aɖe gale GPL dzɔtsoƒe la me alo ne ʋu ƒe nɔnɔme gbãtɔwo kplɔ ɖe wo nusɔsrɔ̃ ŋu akpa. Wowɔ kɔd la ƒe nɔnɔme dodokpɔ ɖokui ɖe GPL kpɔɖeŋu la ƒe dzɔtsoƒe ŋu le <0/>, eye nunyala ƒe dodokpɔ na eƒe nusɔsɔwo le yiyim. Nu sia nu si tso eme la, woaŋlɔe gbugbɔ alo woatrɔ nɔnɔmee. Va se ɖe esime dodokpɔ la nawu enu la, míegblɔna be eŋuɖoɖo la nye ao o.",
  "faq.questions": "Nubiabiawo",
  "faq.shipsArtInterface": "Ʋuwo, nɔnɔmetatawo, afimeɖoɖo kple nu bubuwo, ɖe alesi fetu a ɖe mɔ ɖi. <0>Ðoɖoɖa si le axa sia dzi<\/0> lɔa nu sia nu eye wòafia teƒeɖoɖo sia teƒeɖoɖo kple eƒe nɔnɔmetatawɔla.",
  "faq.shipsUpgradesPlanned": "Wotsɔ ɖo ɖoɖo be woate ŋu axɔ ʋuwo kple tsitsiwo to fefe me alo woatsɔ wo. Wole nɔ ɖoɖom alesi ʋu siwo woxɔ fetu na la nanɔ dzɔdzɔe le ame kple ame ƒe aʋawɔwɔ me.",
  "faq.thatPlanFree": "Esia nye ɖoɖo la: fefe si womexɔa fetu le o kple fefe me ga kple nuɖɔɖɔ siwo woate ŋu atsɔ. Womewɔe haɖe o.",
  "faq.wasAnyoneS": "Ðe wokopi ame aɖe ƒe dɔ?",
