  "faq.windowsPcThere": "Windows PC. Do go ƒe ŋkeke kple asi ƒe xexlẽme meli haɖe o.",
  "footer.anthropicClaudeClaude": "Anthropic, Claude kple Claude Code nye Anthropic, PBC ƒe dzesiwo. Unreal Engine kple Epic Games nye Epic Games, Inc. ƒe dzesiwo. Blender nye Blender Foundation ƒe dzesi. Quake III Arena kple Elite Dangerous nye woƒe nɔlawo ƒe dzesiwo. Ŋkɔ siawo katã nye woƒe nɔlawo tɔ eye wozãa wo be woaɖe nu siwo wogblɔ ŋu la afia ko. Orion-81 mesɔ kple wo ɖeke o, meku ɖe wo ɖeke ŋu o, eye wometsɔ ɖeke dzi o.",
  "footer.aspirationalNoPartnership": "Mɔkpɔkpɔ. Hadzɔhadzɔ, ƒomedodo alo dzi tsɔtsɔ aɖeke meli o.",
