  "footer.notLiveYet": "Meɖe go haɖe o",
  "footer.oneItemStill": "Nu ɖeka gakpɔ le eme: fefe ƒe kɔd si tso GPL kpɔɖeŋu la me ƒe <0>mɔɖeɖe ƒe dodokpɔ<\/0>. Wowɔ kɔd la ƒe nɔnɔme dodokpɔ ɖokui ɖe kpɔɖeŋu la ƒe dzɔtsoƒe ŋu le <1/>, eye nunyala ƒe dodokpɔ na eƒe nusɔsɔwo le yiyim.",
  "footer.orion81Completely": "<0>Orion-81 nye dɔ si AI wɔ katã.<\/0> Orion-81 ŋutɔ ƒe kɔd tso Claude Code gbɔ, gɔmeɖola fia mɔe; ʋuwo, anyigbagbɔwo, nɔnɔmewo kple ɣliwo tso dɔwɔnu siwo Claude Code ŋlɔ me. Open-source agbalẽ siwo wòzãna la le ŋkɔ te le <1>'Menye AI wɔ o'<\/1> te.",
