  "maps.withoutScriptsThis": "Ne script mele dɔ wɔm o la, ta sia nye ɖoɖo bɔbɔe. Nɔnɔmetata sia nɔnɔmetata tso fefe la me.",
  "meta.description": "Orion-81 nye ʋua ƒe aʋawɔwɔ ƒe fefe si wowɔ ablɔɖe le AI ɖeɖe me ɖeka, ale be eƒe fetu nate ŋu axɔ nɔnɔmetatawɔlawo kple software-ŋutinyalawo siwo ƒe dɔ AI ɖe le wo si. Kpɔ ʋuwo, anyigbagbɔwo kple aʋawɔnuwo si wowɔ vaseɖe fifia.",
