  "why.anthropic": "Na Anthropic",
  "why.anthropicSEconomic": "<0>Anthropic ƒe Economic Index (<1/>)<\/0> kpɔ be dɔwɔla siwo ƒe dɔ dze egɔme te kpɔna be dɔ gedeawo ƒe akpa gãtɔ AI ate ŋu awɔ.",
  "why.anthropicSEconomic2": "<0>Anthropic ƒe ga ƒe sewɔɖoɖo (<1/>)<\/0> biaa dɔwɔƒewo be woafia nu amewo gbugbɔ eye woatrɔ wo ayi dɔ bubu me tsɔ wu be woakpa wo ɖa.",
  "why.anthropicSReview": "<0>Anthropic ƒe dodokpɔ na nusɔsrɔ̃ gbugbɔ ƒe kpeɖodzi (<1/>)<\/0> kpɔ be ɖoɖo siwo ku ɖe dɔwɔla kple dɔdzikpɔƒe ŋu eye wokpɔ nɔnɔme ɖe wo ŋu la wɔa dɔ nyuie wu.",
  "why.askSimpleFive": "Biabia la bɔbɔe: Claude zikpui atɔ̃ be míadze egɔme. Ne gɔmeɖola ate ŋu ana ame siwo ɖe ŋusẽ eye wodi be yewoawɔ dɔ nanɔ wo ŋu la, míaɖe alesi woate ŋu azã AI kple tameɖoɖo nyui be woawɔ nu nyui afia.",
  "why.context": "Nyawo",
  "why.designersEngineers": "Na nɔnɔmetatawɔlawo kple software-ŋutinyalawo",
  "why.everyItemBelow": "Nu sia nu si le ete nye ɖoɖo alo woaɖe gbeƒãe gake. Nu aɖeke si le afisia womeɖo kpe edzi o, eye xexlẽme aɖeke mede ŋugbe o.",
  "why.founderWentFrom": "Gɔmeɖola aɖe zɔ tso kpɔɖeŋu va ɖe 0.6.1 le ŋkeke <0/> me. Bu nu si ƒuƒoƒo dedie si me ame atɔ̃ le ate ŋu awɔ.",
  "why.fromAnthropic": "Tso Anthropic gbɔ",
  "why.fromBackers": "Tso kpekpeɖeŋulawo gbɔ",
  "why.fullyDisclosedAi": "Fefe si AI wɔ si woɖe gaglãgbe blibo, kple dɔ si fiafilawo ate ŋu akpɔ, si wotsɔ ɖo ɖoɖo be wòayi Unreal Engine 5 (mɔɖegbalẽ ƒe afɔ 3).",
  "why.fullyDocumentedExample": "Kpɔɖeŋu si woŋlɔ blibo le agentic wɔwɔ ŋu, tso mɔ̃ me va ɖe fefe me (repository, tracker kple wɔwɔ sia wɔwɔ si wokpe wolé ɖo), kple dodokpɔ sue si le dɔwɔwɔ me le mɔ ɖeka si dzi AI ƒe viwo ate ŋu akpe ɖe amewo si wòkpa ɖa ŋu.",
  "why.fundingGoalAnnounced": "Ga ƒoƒo ƒe taɖodzinu: woaɖe gbeƒãe emegbe.",
  "why.kickstarterRoadmapPhase": "Kickstarter (mɔɖegbalẽ ƒe afɔ 5) nye ga ƒoƒo na dukɔ ƒe ɖoɖo gbãtɔ. Eƒe ga nye be woaxɔ dɔwɔla gbãtɔwo kple nɔnɔmetatawɔlawo siwo ƒe dɔ AI ɖe le wo si (afɔ 6), siwo emegbe atsi AI ƒe nuwo teƒe ɖeka ɖeka. <0>Nu si ɖoɖo gbãtɔ la xea fetu na, dɔ sia dɔ: woaɖe gbeƒãe emegbe.<\/0>",
  "why.linksContextOnly": "Ka siwo le afisia nye nyawo ɖeɖe gɔme koe, eye metsɔa dzi aɖeke o.",
  "why.n06WhyMatters": "06 · Nukatae wònye vevi",
  "why.orion81Tests": "Orion-81 dzroa tamesusu ma ƒe nɔnɔme sue ɖeka. Enye ɖoɖo, kple dɔwɔla aɖeke meli haɖe o.",
  "why.plannedPaidCredited": "Wotsɔ ɖo ɖoɖo: dɔ si woxɔa fetu le eye woŋlɔa ŋkɔ, si tsia AI ƒe nuwo teƒe ɖeka ɖeka, ɖe alesi fetu a ɖe mɔ ɖi.",
  "why.publishersEngineMakers": "Na ɖeɖefialawo kple mɔ̃wɔlawo",
  "why.routesThatExist": "Mɔ siwo li le Anthropic ƒe dukɔ ƒe ɖoɖowo me la dometɔ aɖewo nye Claude for Startups (credit kple Applied AI office hours) kple Claude Founder House ƒe nudzɔdzɔwo. Orion-81 hã ate ŋu anye dɔwɔƒe na dodokpɔlawo siwo le AI-ga ƒe dɔ gbugbɔ xɔxɔ srɔ̃m. Dzi tsɔtsɔ alo ɖoɖo aɖeke meli o.",
  "why.studyingAiFunded": "Ðe èle AI-ga ƒe dɔ gbugbɔ xɔxɔ srɔ̃m? <0>Nyatakaka ƒe kadodo gbɔna kpuie.<\/0>",
  "why.whatWeAsking": "Nu si míele biam",
  "why.whyMatters": "Nukatae wònye vevi"
